5,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to see where our recent starts fell apart. I'll check the board minutes on a jointly run clinic and the visit completion on the shared nursing round.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I'm interested in the actual impact on patients. I will review the readmission figures during the call-back trial and what the booking system records.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I'll focus on the people. I'm looking into ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, as well as the therapy and midwifery staffing review.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I need to know the financial reality. I'll examine this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the physical capacity. I will check rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and the data agreements with outside surgeries.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
