25,2,1,talk,Midori,,"It seems joint ventures are fragile here; one closed because neither department wanted the budget line. Also, shared nursing rounds suffered heavily from missed visits.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The call-back trial actually reduced readmissions for the elderly, but the booking system is a black hole for any work without a fixed appointment.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"We have a crisis in ward nursing with high agency costs, but interestingly, the midwifery rota has quite a bit of slack.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Shion,,"Our budget is down by a quarter, and floor space fitting is now a cost. Also, off-site contacts bring in no regional funding.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The car park and rooms are full by mid-morning, and our data agreements with outside surgeries are taking over a year to sign.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, if off-site work earns nothing, we must be careful about programs that move care into the community.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Midori, that's a point. But @Shizue, if the rooms are full, we almost have to move things off-site.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shizue, if the booking system is as limited as Jonathan says, any flexible service will just disappear from the reports.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, the staffing slack in midwifery is a rare positive. We should look for ways to utilize that.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, the data agreement delays mean any program relying on outside surgeries will stall for months.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Misaki, if ward nursing is that thin, we cannot add any burden to the current ward staff.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, the budget cut means we can't afford expensive new builds. We need something lean.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, I agree. Using the midwifery slack seems like the most logical path to avoid agency costs.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Midori, the failure of the joint clinic suggests we need a very clear budget owner, not a shared one.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, the missed visits in the nursing round suggest that home-based care is physically unreliable.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
